OL,3,GNEWSATeen footballer comes third in
OL,4,Aworld championships
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has established himself as
OL,7,Fone of the world's best freestyle
OL,8,Ffootballers for his age after finishing
OL,9,Fthird in a world championship.
OL,11,FJames Taylor, 14, saw off competition
OL,12,Fat the NextGen World Football Freestyle
OL,13,FChampionships in the Netherlands, with
OL,14,Fa performance that has added to a
OL,15,Fgrowing list of achievements.
OL,17,FSince taking up freestyle football, he
OL,18,Fhas already set five Guinness World
OL,19,FRecords - the most recent being the
OL,20,Fmost "around-the-worlds" in a minute
OL,21,Ffor under-16s.
