OL,3,GNEWSATeen footballer comes third in
OL,4,Aworld championships
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames, from Penarth, Vale of Glamorgan,
OL,7,Fis self-taught, honing his skills by
OL,8,Ftraining daily and watching YouTube
OL,9,Fvideos.
